  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1337747/description_3f8cf385-a0e3-4a95-98b4-11336ee229dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<p>📖 關於：</p>\n<p>Ocean's Delight 是一款針對 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 的擴充模組，主要致力於為海洋增添烹飪內容！&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>發揮您的烹飪技巧，即可準備出多種以海洋生物為食材的豐盛佳餚！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這款 Farmer's Delight 擴充模組專注於為海洋提供更多內容，以滿足我們品嚐深海生物的渴望！！！</p>\n<p>更多模組：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpepacks.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mcpepacks.com</a></p>\n<p>🔨 必要依賴項：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>致謝：本模組為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean's Delight</a> 的移植版本。</p>",
